                                <p><p 'times="""" new="""" roman';="""" line-height:="""" normal;="""" font-size:="""" medium;="""" ""=""""><p 'times="""" new="""" roman';="""" line-height:="""" normal;="""" font-size:="""" medium;="""" ""=""""><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">(Shaheed e kerbala, hey deen ki baqa, zabi hey nainawa husain badshah) x2<br></span></font><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">(Hasher mein rang laiga khune shahida dekhna) x2&nbsp;</span></p><p 'times="""" new="""" roman';="""" line-height:="""" normal;="""" font-size:="""" medium;="""" ""=""""><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">1. (Ayengi jab fatema) x2<br></span></font><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">haal-e- perishan dekhna<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">(Hasher mein rang laiga khune shahida dekhna) x2&nbsp;</span></p><p 'times="""" new="""" roman';="""" line-height:="""" normal;="""" font-size:="""" medium;="""" ""=""""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; ""></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">2. Roo baru baba kay jab khatoon jannat e ayengee ,<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">khali joli sarwar-e- konain ko dekhlai gee ,<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">(phir yakee kehlayenga) x2<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">Mehshar ka maidan dekhna<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">(Hasher mein rang laiga khune shahida dekhna) x2<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; ""><br></span></p><p 'times="""" new="""" roman';="""" line-height:="""" normal;="""" font-size:="""" medium;="""" ""=""""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">3. Rakhdiya barchi ne akber ka kaleja cheer ke,<br>Rukh badal dale hai ummat ne teri tasweer ke,<br>(Malike kawsar zaraa) x2<br>Ummat ke ehsan dekhna<br>(Hasher mein rang laiga khune shahida dekhna) x2<br></span></p><p 'times="""" new="""" roman';="""" line-height:="""" normal;="""" font-size:="""" medium;="""" ""=""""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">4. Asgare masoom ke lab par sawaale aab hai,<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">Bund paani ke liye wu kis kadar betab hai,<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">(Nehr se paani nahi) x2<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">deytay musalman dekhna<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">(Hasher mein rang laiga khune shahida dekhna) x2</span></p><p 'times="""" new="""" roman';="""" line-height:="""" normal;="""" font-size:="""" medium;="""" ""=""""><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">5. Zainab o kulsoom say kehta tha shimr e baad gohar ,<br></span></font><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">shaam mein jawonge nange sar phirongi dar badar,<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">(Karbela ke baad ab) x2<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">Tarikh zindaa dekhna<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">(Hasher mein rang laiga khune shahida dekhna) x2</span></p><p 'times="""" new="""" roman';="""" line-height:="""" normal;="""" font-size:="""" medium;="""" ""=""""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">6. Gham bhalaa gulzaar ka is dil ko roze hashar ka,<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">Jo hai awlaade payamber ki muhabbat se bharaa,<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">(Baksh wa denge use) x2<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">Yasrab ke sultan dekhna<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 19px; font-size: small; "">(Hasher mein rang laiga khune shahida dekhna) x2</span></p></p></p>
                 
                